  "body": "### Your use case\r\n\r\n#### What would you like to do?\r\nI want to be able to use my telephone number with more than 1 account.\r\n\r\n#### Why would you like to do it?\r\nI change accounts occasionally because I am unable to replace the username of my account. Consequently, migration is necessary. However, I want to retain my ease of access to my previous accounts and backup methods of access, because 2FA is enabled for all of them.\r\n\r\n#### How would you like to achieve it?\r\nAllow usage of a telephone number with more than 1 account.\r\n\r\n### Have you considered any alternatives?\r\nYes. 0 exist.\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\nPer https://github.com/vector-im/element-meta/issues/893#issuecomment-1378554941, this has been reported here.",
